.TH XPS13-CAMERA-CHECK 1 "November 2026" "xps13-ubuntu-camera 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
xps13-camera-check \- read-only health check of the Dell XPS 13 camera stack
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xps13-camera-check
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the state of every layer: IPU firmware, sensor drivers, sensors still waiting to bind,
sensor control nodes, camera drivers inside the initramfs, libcamera cameras, PipeWire sources,
the IR illuminator and the Zoom virtual camera relay. Changes nothing; some checks use sudo.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xps13-camera-setup (8),
/usr/share/doc/xps13-ubuntu-camera/troubleshooting.md.gz
